<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standings in the first-class</p>
<p>Sheffield Shield cricket competition on Monday (tabulate under</p>
<p>played, won outright, won on first innings, drawn, lost on first</p>
<p>innings, lost outright, points)</p>
<p> Western Australia  6   4   1   0  0   1   26</p>
<p> Queensland	   5   3   1   0  0   1   20</p>
<p> New South Wales    7   3   1   0  1   2   20</p>
<p> Tasmania	     6   1   1   0  1   3   12</p>
<p> Victoria	     6   2   0   0  1   3   11.7</p>
<p> South Australia    6   1   0   0  1   4    6</p>
<p>Note - Victoria deducted 0.3 points for slow over rate</p>
<p>against New South Wales, Tasmania took first innings</p>
<p>points</p>
<p>before losing outright to Victoria and Western</p>
<p>Australia.</p>
</text>
